   $q$Which choice is the best summary of the story?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Amara is the best piano player in her school and wins first prize at the spring recital.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"adds-false-detail"},{"text":"Amara struggles with one hard part of her recital piece, practices it slowly by itself and plays it well at the recital.","is_correct":true},{"text":"Amara's brother Kofi sits on the couch and asks why she keeps starting her song over.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"too-narrow"},{"text":"Amara gives up on her recital piece and chooses an easier song for the spring show.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Amara struggles with one hard part of her recital piece, practices it slowly by itself and plays it well at the recital.$q$, $q$A good summary tells the problem, how Amara responds and how it ends. Kofi's question is only one moment, so that choice leaves out most of the story.$q$, 'draft', 'dc2beff6-6ff1-5e1c-98e3-22c9ed438ee1')
