   $q$What claim were Darnell and Yuki testing?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Large windows let more sound into a room.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"Sunlight makes bean plants grow taller.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"confuses-cause-effect"},{"text":"Playing music makes houseplants grow faster.","is_correct":true},{"text":"Bean plants need water every single morning.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"too-narrow"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Playing music makes houseplants grow faster.$q$, $q$The first paragraph says the blog claimed "playing music makes houseplants grow faster." Sunlight is the other explanation Yuki raises, not the claim they set out to test.$q$, 'draft', 'eb1b33e5-e4ea-50ae-9236-f56df6d09c92')
