   $q$What is the author's point of view about not keeping score for the youngest players?$q$, $q$[{"text":"It should be used for players of every age, including older teams.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"exaggerates-position"},{"text":"It has helped young players by giving everyone a fair chance to play.","is_correct":true},{"text":"It has made games boring, so the league should bring scores back.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"reverses-position"},{"text":"It has caused more young players to quit the league each season.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-detail"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$It has helped young players by giving everyone a fair chance to play.$q$, $q$The author describes more playing time, more new moves, and fewer players leaving, so the author supports the change. The author says older players "should play for a score," so it is not meant for every age.$q$, 'draft', '3ca7b49f-54a3-590a-9801-d96b1798b506')
