   $q$How does the author respond to the parents who were upset about the change?$q$, $q$[{"text":"The author agrees with part of their view but says it fits older players better.","is_correct":true},{"text":"The author decides the parents were right and plans to bring back scoring.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"reverses-position"},{"text":"The author ignores the parents and talks only about what the coaches wanted.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-structure"},{"text":"The author says the parents were wrong to think that losing teaches anything.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-detail"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$The author agrees with part of their view but says it fits older players better.$q$, $q$The author says, "I agree that older players should play for a score," and "Learning to handle a loss is a real skill," before explaining why young children are different. The author does not dismiss the parents.$q$, 'draft', '3ca7b49f-54a3-590a-9801-d96b1798b506')
