   $q$What is the author's point of view about feeding bread to the ducks?$q$, $q$[{"text":"It is the only reason that families still visit Willow Pond.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"It is fine as long as visitors toss it from the wooden dock.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-detail"},{"text":"It seems kind, but it harms both the ducks and the pond.","is_correct":true},{"text":"It is a healthy treat that helps young ducks learn to fly.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"reverses-position"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$It seems kind, but it harms both the ducks and the pond.$q$, $q$The author says it "looks like a kind thing to do" but explains that bread leaves ducks unhealthy and feeds algae in the water. The passage says bread can cause wing problems, not help ducks fly.$q$, 'draft', '37f66543-ece6-5141-a4d1-450198018115')
