   $q$According to the passage, why did workers pack sawdust or straw around the ice blocks?$q$, $q$[{"text":"The packing made the blocks easier to slide on land.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"The packing slowed down how fast the ice melted.","is_correct":true},{"text":"The packing helped the horses walk safely on the lake.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"confuses-details"},{"text":"The packing kept the blocks clean enough to eat.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$The packing slowed down how fast the ice melted.$q$, $q$Paragraph 3 says, "This packing slowed the melting a great deal." The horses are mentioned only in connection with thick ice on the lake, not the packing.$q$, 'draft', '99647ec2-d178-53a7-96fa-253da26efcc8')
