   $q$According to the passage, what happens when the muscles around a color sac pull?$q$, $q$[{"text":"The skin raises small bumps like coral.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"confuses-details"},{"text":"The octopus squirts ink and jets away.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"confuses-details"},{"text":"The sac shrinks and the color fades away.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"reverses-detail"},{"text":"The sac stretches and shows more color.","is_correct":true}]$q$::jsonb, $q$The sac stretches and shows more color.$q$, $q$Paragraph 2 says that when the muscles pull, "the sac stretches and shows more color." Shrinking and fading is what happens when the muscles relax.$q$, 'draft', 'fdd8d2ba-d0d3-5ea0-af25-191be06d1a27')
